&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About Flipp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp partners with the largest North American retailers and brands to deliver local promotions and savings to millions of engaged shoppers daily, driving superior returns on investments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help people make smarter shopping decisions with autonomy and accountability. With rising living costs, Flipp&#39;s mission is crucial. Our Shopper Consideration Platform allows retailers and manufacturers to create digital experiences from their savings &amp;amp; deals content, aiding shoppers in deciding what to buy and where to buy it. Together, we make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2024, Flipp joined forces with the European company &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://shopfully.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Shopfully&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, creating a global leader in the sector. Together, we reach 400 million households and serve over 1,000 top retailers and brands across 27 markets, including Europe, Canada, the USA, Latin America, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our five principles, Progress Over Perfection, Clarity Through Transparency, Learn Loudly, Challenge with Empathy, and Always Build Better, bring a relentless progress mindset to life. They’re not just slogans, but they’re the behaviours we expect, reward, and hold ourselves accountable to. You&#39;ll be equipped to make an impact, realize your potential, and stay inspired every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Customer Success Implementation Manager owns the entire journey of bringing solutions to life for clients. From the initial planning and scoping to launching, the Implementation Manager serves as the main point of contact during the implementation journey. This position involves guiding clients with expert advice, tackling issues proactively, and ensuring every project is completed efficiently, on time, and to top-quality standards. The Implementation Manager will support internal stakeholders across the organization in launching new products from concept development to deployment, work closely with cross-functional teams to design, plan, execute, and build feasible, scalable solutions that fulfill Flipp&#39;s vision, and drive program success by applying deep technical knowledge, program management best practices, and strong communication skills to ensure alignment between stakeholders, product teams, and engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get the opportunity to do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2027&quot; data-local-id=&quot;41a7f1edcb27&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive Revenue and Build Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2068&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1af1d9f4b96b&quot;&gt;Lead implementation processes from kickoff to go-live, understand client objectives and configure product solutions to meet their business needs, owning internal system integrations and required vendor management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2285&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77800b4a5664&quot;&gt;Build and maintain relationships with internal and external stakeholders to drive collaboration and alignment throughout the onboarding process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2433&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cffb9ff906e9&quot;&gt;Drive customer engagement and adoption by delivering onboarding, training, and strategic guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2535&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c4a1d0a851c5&quot;&gt;Design and optimize implementation processes to improve efficiency, scalability, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2646&quot; data-local-id=&quot;acb011eec3b3&quot;&gt;Monitor implementation progress, proactively identify risks, and escalate as necessary. Collect feedback and insights to drive continuous improvement in onboarding processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2824&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aa466eab1b3f&quot;&gt;Anchor the delivery of a solution; ensure deadlines are met, and champion the communication to key stakeholders on a project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2953&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ed53f987554&quot;&gt;Lead and provide direction to Implementation Specialists for the execution of implementation and ongoing projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3071&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6bde5a48bf76&quot;&gt;Serve as an escalation point for complex customer implementation and delivery issues and work to resolve them swiftly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3193&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f811cb1a7bc0&quot;&gt;Own early product adoption onboardings to support building end to end workflows that enable long term functionality and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3329&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6798ad00f2b7&quot;&gt;Holding internal stakeholders accountable to deliverables, timelines, etc. to ensure projects and onboardings stay on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3457&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b71a69bf3eec&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Product Knowledge &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3492&quot; data-local-id=&quot;05589664dbe9&quot;&gt;Be a subject matter expert in Flipp+Shopfully products within the Customer Success portfolio and how to utilize them to achieve business goals. Understanding how we can streamline and improve processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3698&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9b30b1f712e8&quot;&gt;Evaluate existing processes, propose and lead initiatives to improve efficiency and enhance overall team productivity. Driving standardization and process improvement, outsourcing or automating manual processes and focusing on scaling existing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3956&quot; data-local-id=&quot;222db241ec04&quot;&gt;Develop training programs and onboarding materials to support the growth and performance of the implementation team and additional internal/external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4122&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cac7a6811ae7&quot;&gt;Synthesizing data observations into actionable insights, taking a proactive approach to shape and influence stakeholder expectations and strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4272&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fd05fe1c3a4&quot;&gt;Advocates for product features and improvements as the voice of the customer and works cross-functionally with internal product teams to champion change. Acts as a voice of the customer, consolidating external feedback, sharing with the appropriate product teams to drive action and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4570&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94a1200584f7&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain reporting dashboards, centralizing insights into actionable playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4665&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ac6b9a6cfd4&quot;&gt;Assist in developing and implementing scalable processes, tools, and best practices to enhance the customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4785&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f3c8d81333ea&quot;&gt;Understanding the product on a technical level and knowing the people in the organization that can offer the best information related to specific product issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4950&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f3235e39c5fc&quot;&gt;Proactively seek to optimize the implementation lifecycle by leveraging available platforms (e.g., Salesforce, ClickUp).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5074&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb5a437aff9f&quot;&gt;Proactively identify utilization of AI-driven tools to automate repetitive tasks, unlocking greater functionality and scalability. Acting as an subject matter expert of available tools and able to mentor others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5289&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c145dd3195a&quot;&gt;Proactively synthesizes market and client feedback to drive product innovation, holding teams accountable to creating meaningful action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5429&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8d5d0f834437&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Project Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5451&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4703f6c6dc3e&quot;&gt;Lead high-priority, division-wide initiatives by aligning diverse stakeholders on shared roadmaps, managing resource allocation, and mitigating risks to deliver scalable solutions that meet core business objectives on time and within budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5696&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a1c27c5b225&quot;&gt;Develop and manage customized onboarding plans based on customer needs, goals, and success criteria - conducting training sessions and creating documentation to support efficient product deliveries and launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5911&quot; data-local-id=&quot;87099edfd510&quot;&gt;Develop project plans, setting clear objectives and overseeing the end-to-end completion of retailer onboardings and product integrations/launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6062&quot; data-local-id=&quot;184b71fa7c65&quot;&gt;Utilize effective communication and collaboration amongst internal teams and clients to drive successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6180&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b9192345b581&quot;&gt;Take on and manage additional ad-hoc projects that contribute to the team&#39;s strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6281&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e9d36d7108ed&quot;&gt;Partner closely with multiple internal teams to ensure alignment between technical execution and product strategy. Coordinate delivery within established frameworks and facilitate effective program ceremonies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6494&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed634476bcab&quot;&gt;Provide clear, actionable status updates to stakeholders. Synthesize technical concepts for non-technical audiences and ensure visibility into program health, risks, and mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6685&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b76999a75ac8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Insights &amp;amp; Trends&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ee6c23355d4b&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of retailer/industry and understand account/opportunity specific metrics/KPIs to drive successful outcomes. Ability to anticipate emerging trends and insights to drive retention, applying cross-account/product learnings, understand account/opportunity specific metrics/KPIs to drive successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7032&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7c071290aa97&quot;&gt;Synthesizing data observations into actionable insights, taking a proactive approach to shape and influence stakeholder expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7169&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4880b74f496e&quot;&gt;Ownership of retailer content metrics and results to drive optimization strategies. Leveraging advanced analytics and dashboards to maintain comprehensive account overviews. Synthesize data and observations into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7405&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7b59ae944374&quot;&gt;Analyze and assess retailers digital content; ability to identify content gaps and identify segment-specific content marketing plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7542&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c750f8209dd6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Coaching &amp;amp; Performance Management (If Applicable)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7595&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d714f243b9a4&quot;&gt;Mentor and support team members by regularly tracking team KPIs, keeping a pulse on team satisfaction across the team and coordinating Team Health initiatives. Responsible for performance management, coaching and scaling a team. You will be responsible for supporting their career/growth plans at Flipp through ongoing training and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7940&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fd6dc34c4934&quot;&gt;Monitor team performance using KPIs and metrics (e.g., Retention rate, churn rate, health scores, revenue) and take data-driven actions to improve. Facilitate regular team meetings, performance reviews, and development planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8172&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3ea6dd601df2&quot;&gt;Ensure pod allocation and capacity is at an optimal state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9125&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c8bc9f04458a&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in customer success, project management, or implementation, preferably within the Ad-Tech/SaaS space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9252&quot; data-local-id=&quot;08d5486ecefd&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills with the ability to build trust and influence strategic decisions across both internal and external leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9423&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5220021a3e5c&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple complex projects simultaneously, with strong skills in timeline management, risk mitigation, and workback schedule (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;WBS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9594&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e585555ca669&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills to identify and mitigate risks during the implementation process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9708&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ee432b721636&quot;&gt;The ability to work independently and as part of a team in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9805&quot; data-local-id=&quot;149c34acd4db&quot;&gt;Experience using CRM and project management tools such as Salesforce, Gainsight, Asana, or Jira.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9905&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d8fe89a4d8e1&quot;&gt;A proactive mindset regarding emerging trends in digital merchandising and a commitment to leveraging data and AI tools to drive team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Support You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Total Rewards philosophy is to ensure that you are rewarded for impact, take part in accelerated career growth, thrive with highly flexible benefits, and are empowered to do your best work in a remote-first environment. In alignment with our overall Total Rewards Philosophy, we believe compensation should be fair, clear, consistent, and aligned to growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Base Hiring Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$85,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$95,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our promise to each other:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;width: 83.5859%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 53.174%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 46.8272%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 53.174%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, collaborative environment where your voice matters&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The tools and opportunities you need to grow and develop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every opportunity to own your success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 46.8272%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your authentic self, every day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your best work, from anywhere&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appetite for learning, curiosity, and a growth mindset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation, initiative and the mind of an entrepreneur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Here&#39;s how to apply:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is currently vacant and open for applications. If you’re interested in working with us on the future of shopping, fill out the fields below and submit your application. While experience and skill sets are valuable, growth potential and attitudes are equally important. If you’re prepared to grow dramatically with your team at a world-class learning organization, consider applying. We understand that the most creative solutions require diversity in thought and life experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, ancestry, religion, creed, sex, national or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, family status, disability, or gender identity or expression or any other protected grounds. We are proud to be a welcoming space for employees, of every background, to bring their whole selves to work with confidence. Flipp is committed to providing appropriate accommodations to ensure our selection process is equitable, and such accommodations can be made available on request. If you require an accommodation, please contact your dedicated recruiter directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring is a deeply human process; therefore, we use AI in limited, administrative ways to help streamline our hiring process. An AI-powered scheduling tool assists with coordinating interviews, and our applicant tracking system may use AI to identify relevant keywords within applications. We do not use AI to assess your application, make hiring decisions, or conduct interviews. All evaluations are completed by real people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A member of our recruitment team will respond to you in the coming weeks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
